                  eMAIL, v1.0r (20-Dec-95) by Adolescent


iNFO
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is simply a colorful ANSI/LIGHTBAR (if you are not familliar with that
phrase then just load the thing and you will see...) eMail menu for CNet/3.  

(really not much purpose in life, but, hey, it combines all the MR, MS, MV)

The color is configurable, and, you can change the pic if you want to.

Please DO NOT modify the program, if you need it to do something else, just
let me know and I will add it for you...


DiSCLAiMER
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This CNet/3 mod is provided AS IS.  Adolescent, or 1oo%, makes no claims as
to the problems it could cause.  WARNING:  PETS MAY EXPERIENCE OVERHEATING!


iNSTALL
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1)  Copy the file 'eMail.rexx' to wherever you want it.  (works best in the
    'PFILES:1oo/eMAIL/' dir so it doesn't get lost... 8)

2)  Copy the file 'sys.eMail' to the 'SYSTEXT:' dir...

3)  Load 'CNET:BBSTEXT' into your best text editor and add the following to
    the end of '2; Available everywhere'

        EMail   |#0pfiles:1oo/eMail/eMail.rexx}

    (make sure you put the propper path to where you put the .rexx file...)

4)  Re-load the BBSTEXT/BBSMENU from the pulldown menu.

5)  Type EM or email at any prompt and you are on your way...


